  <h2>About me</h2>
  <div class="about-copy"><p>I’m Angello, a software engineer and founder based in New Jersey. My path into technology started with a curiosity about people — from studying psychology in Peru to working in banking and building digital products.</p><p>That mix shapes how I work. I care about how an experience feels as much as how it functions: the small detail that makes an app easier, a community more welcoming, or a story more personal.</p><p>I founded Zelandaware to bring my own ideas to life. Today, my work spans mobile apps, web experiences, and projects like Peruanify and Zenzeito. Different ideas, the same instinct: <strong>make something that matters to someone.</strong></p><div class="about-links"><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/angellonunez" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/angellonunez" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div></div>
